{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在音乐感受的细腻度和具体性上明显不如X，尤其缺少对节奏、音型、音区、和声变化及音乐动势的细致描写。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的叙述更像一个连续展开的内心故事，人物为什么离开、为什么怀念、为什么犹豫、最后为什么选择继续生活，因果关系交代得更自然，普通观众比较容易跟上。X的重点词突出，音乐感受也丰富得多，尤其能捕捉细微的声音变化，但感受信息过于密集，部分段落容易让人忙于辨认碎片，而忽略人物正在经历的事情。综合来看，Y更容易让观众在听音乐的同时理解人物、抓住故事，并感到前后连贯。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a6114839-43a0-4083-81e9-83c27c141b6f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T184839897697Z", "elapsed_seconds": 111.609, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T18:50:31.506035+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c3262c59dccddb091e6b2e050344f19849368394848b4dcbe87096de8941aed4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\g